// JobHuntDashboard.js
// Job Copilot: CV → profile, live job search scored against it, a "should I
// apply?" evaluator (keyword scan + AI judgement), a pipeline board, and
// human-in-the-loop application emails.
//
// Two modes:
//  - Owner (Laxman, signed in): his real pipeline, Firestore mirror, tracked
//    CV links, one-click Gmail send, scheduled follow-ups.
//  - Visitor: a private sandbox. Their CV and pipeline live only in their
//    browser (separate storage keys); nothing is synced, tracked or sent.

