// jobBoards.js
// Company career pages, straight from the ATS. Greenhouse, Lever and Ashby
// all publish open, CORS-enabled JSON for their public job boards, so the
// browser can read them directly: full job descriptions (not the 500-char
// snippets aggregators return) and, for Greenhouse, the real application
// questions — which is what the Apply Kit drafts answers for.

